    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CURVED SPACE BATTLEGROUNDS</strong></h2>Experience <strong>curved space</strong> multiplayer shooter action in challenging battlegrounds that expose a player 360 degrees. Pick a character, select a desired skin and spawn to play!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/3299c07ca93617826709700d8d1e10bf.poster.avif?t=1699072963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/3299c07ca93617826709700d8d1e10bf.webm?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/3299c07ca93617826709700d8d1e10bf.mp4?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game contains 3 maps spread over 2 modes: <strong>STANDARD</strong> and <strong>RAMPAGE</strong>. There are 15+ weapons, explosive and gadgets that provide special abilities to players. There are 4 characters to pick from and each providing a set of skins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STANDARD MODE</strong></h2>In the standard mode, the player spawns at the edge of the starting circle, scavenges for weapons and supplies and battles for survival against a shrinking circle. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/f886808c9d2ee224078425ab8fce8f39.poster.avif?t=1699072963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/f886808c9d2ee224078425ab8fce8f39.webm?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/f886808c9d2ee224078425ab8fce8f39.mp4?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RAMPAGE MODE</strong></h2>The rampage mode spans over two curved space maps and the players compete for the most number of skills. Take cover under a building or be in the open to let your opponents taste wrath. This mode is time bound.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/d94db20eb5d9e8bf27243c522cd75877.poster.avif?t=1699072963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/d94db20eb5d9e8bf27243c522cd75877.webm?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/d94db20eb5d9e8bf27243c522cd75877.mp4?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CURVED SPACE BATTLEGROUNDS</strong></h2>Experience <strong>curved space</strong> multiplayer shooter action in challenging battlegrounds that expose a player 360 degrees. Pick a character, select a desired skin and spawn to play!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/3299c07ca93617826709700d8d1e10bf.poster.avif?t=1699072963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/3299c07ca93617826709700d8d1e10bf.webm?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/3299c07ca93617826709700d8d1e10bf.mp4?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game contains 3 maps spread over 2 modes: <strong>STANDARD</strong> and <strong>RAMPAGE</strong>. There are 15+ weapons, explosive and gadgets that provide special abilities to players. There are 4 characters to pick from and each providing a set of skins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STANDARD MODE</strong></h2>In the standard mode, the player spawns at the edge of the starting circle, scavenges for weapons and supplies and battles for survival against a shrinking circle. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/f886808c9d2ee224078425ab8fce8f39.poster.avif?t=1699072963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/f886808c9d2ee224078425ab8fce8f39.webm?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/f886808c9d2ee224078425ab8fce8f39.mp4?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RAMPAGE MODE</strong></h2>The rampage mode spans over two curved space maps and the players compete for the most number of skills. Take cover under a building or be in the open to let your opponents taste wrath. This mode is time bound.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/d94db20eb5d9e8bf27243c522cd75877.poster.avif?t=1699072963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/d94db20eb5d9e8bf27243c522cd75877.webm?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432510/extras/d94db20eb5d9e8bf27243c522cd75877.mp4?t=1699072963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "VECTER ASSAULT is a unique curved space multiplayer shooter. Battle for survival against opponents in futuristic arenas or battlegrounds. Experience fast-paced combat action and compete to be the last survivor or battle for the most kills.",
